&=9.94 \times 10^{-19} \mathrm{~J} \\
&=6.20 \mathrm{eV}
\end{aligned}
\]
The photo-ejected electron has kinetic energy
\[
K E=E_{\text {photon }}-\phi_{o}=6.20 \mathrm{eV}-4.40 \mathrm{eV}=1.80 \mathrm{eV}=\boxed{2.88e-19} \mathrm{~J}
\]']

